{"id":"accc6d580eff4d8a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Complete Suborder","display":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder — ZFC Forcing Complete Suborder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder — ZFC Forcing Complete Suborder","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-maximal-antichain]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder — ZFC Forcing Complete Suborder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"58-df-maximal-antichain\">58-df-maximal-antichain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"58-df-maximal-antichain\">58-df-maximal-antichain</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}suborder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathbb P\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}=\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\cap(\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}p\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}suborder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathbb P\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}=\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\cap(\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}p\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The inclusion preserves order and compatibility, and every maximal antichain of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> remains maximal in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-maximal-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-maximal-antichain]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-maximal-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-maximal-antichain]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}suborder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathbb P\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}=\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\cap(\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}p\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"40010752104d30b5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteSuborder}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1952","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-suborder]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","fb7c32a0f0383968","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}